NOTE ON AUDITED THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE

This licence covers Goalpost itself. It does not extend to any audited
upstream project.

- Target #1 (`src/goalpost/upstream.py`) carries NO licence upstream. Its
  prompt text is therefore never stored in this repository: it is fetched at
  runtime from a pinned commit, verified by content hash, parsed without
  execution, and referenced in artifacts only by URL, commit SHA and hash.
- Target #2 (`src/goalpost/upstream_csa.py`) is MIT-licensed upstream. Its
  three prompt templates are vendored here under that licence, with
  attribution and provenance recorded in the module.

Audit transcripts under `audits/` are records of this project's own API
calls, made on its own keys, and are published as evidence.
